msgid "The Android apps on this computer. Open them, change them in App info, or uninstall the ones you installed.\nAndroid starts when you open this page."
msgstr "此计算机上的 Android 应用。可以打开它们、在“应用信息”中更改，或卸载您安装的应用。\n打开此页面时 Android 会启动。"

