msgstr "已停止 {0}。"

msgid "On your desktop"
msgstr "在桌面上"

msgid "Place the widgets your Android apps offer on your desktop. Each widget gets a window of its own, below your other windows.\nPress and hold a widget to edit it: drag it to move it, and drag its handles to resize it.\nRight-click a widget for its settings, its sizes and Remove. Android starts when you open this page."
msgstr "将 Android 应用提供的小部件放到桌面上。每个小部件都有自己的窗口，位于其他窗口下方。\n长按小部件即可编辑：拖动以移动，拖动其控制柄以调整大小。\n右键单击小部件可打开其设置、尺寸和“移除”。打开此页面时 Android 会启动。"

msgid "Widgets your apps offer"
msgstr "应用提供的小部件"

msgid "Widgets could not be read or changed"
msgstr "无法读取或更改小部件"

msgid "No widget is on your desktop yet."
msgstr "桌面上还没有小部件。"

msgid "No app in Android offers a widget."
msgstr "Android 中没有应用提供小部件。"

msgid "At {0}, {1}, {2} × {3}"
msgstr "位置 {0}, {1}，大小 {2} × {3}"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

